{"seq":12,"trial_id":"gbrain-memory-2026-10/openclaw-sonnet-gbrain-told-live-mu-memory/ms-07-strategic-owners/r3","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T23:55:48.187Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"b3ae47606963c357e60998cb4e9ca4a2b5ec6ca87db948ce8c0d220f2c4fb757","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's digests say. They mostly refer to accounts by owner (\"Gideon's fleet account\") rather than by name, so some of this is inferred from that wording.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. Nadia Fennimore had it until it was reassigned.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The Sep 30 digest has him on the account, and the 5/4 digest says he took over management of it that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The Mar 2025 digest calls it \"Nadia's medical account\". The Dec 2025 and Sep 30, 2026 digests call it \"Gideon's medical account\".\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I can't confirm an owner. The digests only call it \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\". The Sep 30 digest says Nadia volunteered to run a training session for them, but that doesn't make her the owner. Please check the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\n**Vantorre Group change of hands: 2026-05-04.** The 5/4 digest says \"Effective 2026-05-04, Nadia's old industrial account has been reassigned in the CRM\", and Mateo Quiroga was notified that morning. It then calls it \"Gideon's industrial account\", with ticket #8841 still open. The 4/27 digest still had it as Nadia's.\n\nThe 5/4 digest doesn't name the account in the reassignment line. I'm reading \"Nadia's old industrial account\" as Vantorre Group. The Moss cheat sheet and the 7/1 #strategic-pod thread both use that phrase for it, and the 8/3 incident room confirms Gideon runs it."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
